@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Session Analysis Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>Sliding-Window HuBERT-D Inference and Event Aggregation</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE
participant "session_engine" as Engine #EDE9FE
participant "VoxFlowInferenceEngine" as InfEngine #C4B5FD
participant "HubertMultiLabelClassifier" as HubertModel #C4B5FD
participant "event_aggregator" as Aggregator #DDD6FE
participant "session_summary" as Summary #DDD6FE
database "database\n(voxflow.db)" as DB #ECFDF5
participant "Streamlit Dashboard" as UI #DCFCE7

== 1. Audio Validation & Window Slicing ==

API -> Engine : process_continuous_session(audio_source, filename)
Engine -> Engine : validate_and_load_session_audio(audio_source)
Engine -> Engine : process_session_windows(audio, sr, engine)\n[3.0s window, 1.0s hop]

== 2. Sliding-Window HuBERT-D Multi-Label Inference ==

loop For Each 3.0-Second Audio Window
    Engine -> InfEngine : predict_window(waveform, sample_rate)
    InfEngine -> HubertModel : forward(input_values, attention_mask)
    HubertModel --> InfEngine : logits
    InfEngine -> InfEngine : Apply Sigmoids & locked thresholds\n(Rep: 0.77, Pro: 0.79, Blk: 0.57)
    InfEngine --> Engine : {Rep, Pro, Blk probs, active_labels, is_fluent, confidence}
end

== 3. Event Aggregation & Session Summary ==

Engine -> Aggregator : aggregate_window_events(windows, thresholds)
Aggregator -> Aggregator : Cluster consecutive active windows into discrete events
Aggregator --> Engine : [aggregated_events]

Engine -> Summary : calculate_session_summary(windows, events, duration)
Summary -> Summary : Compute Fluency Ratio & event counts
Summary --> Engine : {session_summary_metrics}

== 4. Persistence & Dashboard Visualization ==

Engine -> DB : save_session_analysis(session_id, windows, events, summary)
DB --> Engine : Persisted atomically
Engine --> API : 200 OK {session_id, fluency_ratio, events}

UI -> DB : get_latest_session() / get_session_details(session_id)
DB --> UI : Stored session summary, windows, events
UI -> UI : Render Summary Metrics, Probability Timeline,\nWindow Audit Table & Event Visualizer

@enduml